   * Added preliminary MacOSX code (Stefhane Conversy). 
   * Fixed bug in CreateMcd (kitaro). 
   * Added a 'NO PIC' image. 
   * Pcsx now compiles without a recompiler. 
   * Same small speedups. 
   * Fixed RTPS/RTPT SXYP fifo issue, thanks to Xeven. 
